                    ],
                    "type": "block_quote"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "The bonafide farmers shall be selected on a first come first serve basis."
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "paragraph"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "bold": true,
                        "text": "Whom to Contact:",
